# ── Project docs ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# docs/ is tracked on purpose. It holds the PRD, the MVP spec, the bug list,
# the Play Store release guide, and the privacy-policy and account-deletion
# pages Play requires a public URL for — none of which exist anywhere else.
# The whole directory is under 2 MB.
